# THE RULE: a file the build READS is an asset and is committed; anything a tool WRITES is
# output and is not. The directories say which is which:
#
#   src/            the build and its generators -- committed
#   data/           FITTED assets the build reads (angel-art, goat-art, quote-screen, ...) -- committed
#   art/            source art (renders, paintings, hand-drawn sprites) -- committed
#   build/          everything a build or tool writes -- ignored, except build/iray.asm: generated,
#                   but committed ON PURPOSE: diffing it between commits shows what a JS change did
#                   to the machine code and the memory map. Both early layout bugs were invisible in
#                   the JS diff, so that churn earns its keep.
#
# build/ holds: iray.prg, diagnostic builds' iray.diag.asm (so a throwaway PX/PY/PA start never
# lands in the tracked iray.asm), compact.mjs's inputs and outputs (iray.aligned/bufsizes/hotloops/
# reserve/syms.json, iray.compact.asm -- a stale copy would relayout the image against a build that
# no longer exists), the sub-builds' .lvl*/.wall*-tables.json, diagnostic dumps (cellscan.json),
# previews and frames, and c64pic's tree.kla for the end scene (see tools/endscene.mjs).
/build/*
!/build/iray.asm

# ---- disks: `node src/build-iray.mjs` writes lest-c64.d64; test builds write zz-*.d64 ----
*.d64
!art/*.d64
# ...except THE game, committed so a visitor can play it without building
!/lest-c64.d64

# data/charset-plan.json is TRACKED. It looks derived and it is not: it is the k-medians fit over a
# 2M-position scan of a shape-rich maze, canonical input to every build, and no level's map is an
# input to it. Untracked, a clean clone would refit the charset against whatever map was built.
# Regenerate deliberately with:
#   CELLSCAN=1 CELLSTEP=0.2 CELLANG=1 node src/build-iray.mjs && node src/charsetgen.mjs

# ---- pictures at the top level are tool output (tools that predate build/) ----
/*.png
/*.gif

# ---- reference material that is not ours to publish (photographs of real objects) ----
art/ref/

# ---- tools ----
tools/node_modules/
tools/package-lock.json
tools/.ship/

# ---- local only ----
.claude/
.DS_Store
CLEANUP-REVIEW.md
loader-v194.zip
krill/loader-rt-c64.prg
*.swp
